      "splashScreen": {
        "type": "splashScreen",
        "title": "City of Albuquerque School Crossings Dashboard",
        "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">APS School crossings have been evaluated based on infrastructure preset (flashers, crossing guards, sidewalks) and given a score summarizing the safety of the crossing. This helps the City prioritize crossing improvements.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;\"><strong>Begin by selecting a school from the list on the left</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:10px;\">The information provided on this site is for informational purposes only and is provided on an \"as is\" basis with no guarantees of completeness, accuracy, and without any warranties of any kind whatsoever, express or implied; the City assumes no responsibility or liability for any errors or omissions in the content of this site or for the use of or actions taken in reliance upon such content.&nbsp;</span><br>&nbsp;</p>",
